{"seq":2,"slug":"thread-dump-deadlock-analysis","title":"线程栈、死锁与线程池耗尽分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/jvm-performance-troubleshooting/hotspots-and-concurrency/thread-dump-deadlock-analysis","wordCount":2467,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"线程栈-死锁与线程池耗尽分析\">线程栈、死锁与线程池耗尽分析</h1><p>线程类故障有个共同特征：<strong>现象是「什么都不做」，根源却是「什么都在等」</strong>。CPU 使用率掉到 5%、接口全部超时、日志停止输出——从指标看像是服务挂了，从线程转储看却是一群线程规规矩矩地堵在同一行。这类问题用堆转储、GC 日志都查不出来，唯一有效的证据是<strong>线程转储（thread dump）</strong>。本文讲清如何采集、如何读、以及四类高频故障的判据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-线程状态与转储的采集\">核心概念：线程状态与转储的采集</h2><p>线程转储是某一瞬间所有 Java 线程的栈快照。JVM 层面的线程状态（<code>Thread.State</code>）只有六种，但<strong>转储里的状态字符串比这六种更有信息量</strong>——它包含 JVM 内部的等待分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转储中的状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型停留位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>RUNNABLE</code></td>\n<td>可运行（注意：<strong>包含正在做 I/O 的线程</strong>）</td>\n<td>业务代码、socket read（可能是在等网络）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BLOCKED</code></td>\n<td>等待 <code>synchronized</code> 监视器</td>\n<td><code>wait to lock &lt;0x...&gt;</code> 行给出锁对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WAITING</code></td>\n<td>无限期等待</td>\n<td><code>Object.wait()</code>、<code>LockSupport.park()</code>、<code>Thread.join()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TIMED_WAITING</code></td>\n<td>限时等待</td>\n<td><code>sleep()</code>、<code>parkNanos()</code>、<code>wait(timeout)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW</code> / <code>TERMINATED</code></td>\n<td>未启动 / 已结束</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个反直觉但极其重要的点：<strong><code>RUNNABLE</code> 不等于在消耗 CPU</strong>。Java 的 <code>RUNNABLE</code> 包含正在进行阻塞式系统调用的线程——一个卡在 <code>SocketInputStream.read</code> 的线程，状态就是 <code>RUNNABLE</code>。把 <code>RUNNABLE</code> 数量当成「活跃线程数」是常见的误判来源，正确做法是看栈顶那一帧是不是 I/O 或 <code>park</code>。</p>\n<p>采集方式按侵入性排：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 非 STW 的 JSON 快照（JDK 21+，首选）&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.dump_to_file -format=json /tmp/threads.json&#10;&#10;# 2. 经典文本转储（需 safepoint 收敛，慢 safepoint 场景可能超时）&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.print -l &gt; /tmp/threads.txt      # -l 显示锁对象&#10;jstack -l &lt;pid&gt; &gt; /tmp/threads.txt                  # 等价&#10;&#10;# 3. 连续多份（判断「卡住」还是「在动」的必要手段）&#10;for i in $(seq 1 5); do&#10;  jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.dump_to_file -format=json /tmp/threads-$i.json&#10;  sleep 3&#10;done&#10;&#10;# 4. 崩溃自动采集&#10;-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError        # 堆转储里也含线程信息&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.print                 # 配合定时任务落盘&#10;&#10;# 5. 在线友好版：只打印最忙的几个&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.print -l | head -100\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 非 STW 的 JSON 快照（JDK 21+，首选）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.dump_to_file</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -format=json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/threads.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 经典文本转储（需 safepoint 收敛，慢 safepoint 场景可能超时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/threads.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # -l 显示锁对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jstack</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/threads.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # 等价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 连续多份（判断「卡住」还是「在动」的必要手段）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">seq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.dump_to_file</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -format=json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/threads-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 崩溃自动采集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 堆转储里也含线程信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 # 配合定时任务落盘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 5. 在线友好版：只打印最忙的几个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -100</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>连续多份转储是区分「死锁」与「慢」的关键</strong>。单份转储只能看到「现在在哪」，多份才能看出「是否在移动」。一个线程连续 5 份都停在同一行 —— 那是阻塞；停在同一方法的相邻行 —— 那是缓慢推进。这个判据比任何单点分析都可靠。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[现象: 接口超时 / CPU 低] --&gt; B[采集连续 3~5 份线程转储]&#10;    B --&gt; C{线程在栈上移动吗?}&#10;    C --&gt;|完全不动| D[阻塞/死锁路径]&#10;    C --&gt;|缓慢移动| E[竞争或下游慢]&#10;    C --&gt;|CPU 高但线程少| F[CPU 密集或 safepoint 问题]&#10;    D --&gt; D1{栈里是否有&lt;br/&gt;BLOCKED 循环?}&#10;    D1 --&gt;|是| D2[死锁: 用 JFR/转储的&lt;br/&gt;Found one Java-level deadlock]&#10;    D1 --&gt;|否| D3[池耗尽 / 等待下游 / latch]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[用 JFR JavaMonitorEnter 看&lt;br/&gt;锁等待时长分布]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[用 jdk.ExecutionSample 看热点]\">flowchart TD\n    A[现象: 接口超时 / CPU 低] --&gt; B[采集连续 3~5 份线程转储]\n    B --&gt; C{线程在栈上移动吗?}\n    C --&gt;|完全不动| D[阻塞/死锁路径]\n    C --&gt;|缓慢移动| E[竞争或下游慢]\n    C --&gt;|CPU 高但线程少| F[CPU 密集或 safepoint 问题]\n    D --&gt; D1{栈里是否有&lt;br/&gt;BLOCKED 循环?}\n    D1 --&gt;|是| D2[死锁: 用 JFR/转储的&lt;br/&gt;Found one Java-level deadlock]\n    D1 --&gt;|否| D3[池耗尽 / 等待下游 / latch]\n    E --&gt; E1[用 JFR JavaMonitorEnter 看&lt;br/&gt;锁等待时长分布]\n    F --&gt; F1[用 jdk.ExecutionSample 看热点]</pre><h2 id=\"死锁-检测与判据\">死锁：检测与判据</h2><p>JVM 自己就能检测 <code>synchronized</code> 死锁，并在文本转储末尾打印：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Found one Java-level deadlock:&#10;=============================&#10;&quot;Thread-1&quot;:&#10;  waiting to lock monitor 0x00007f... (object 0x000000076ab..., a java.lang.Object),&#10;  which is held by &quot;Thread-0&quot;&#10;&quot;Thread-0&quot;:&#10;  waiting to lock monitor 0x00007f... (object 0x000000076ac..., a java.lang.Object),&#10;  which is held by &quot;Thread-1&quot;&#10;Java stack information for the threads listed above:&#10;===================================================&#10;&quot;Thread-1&quot;:&#10;        at com.example.A.b(A.java:20)&#10;        - waiting to lock &lt;0x000000076ab...&gt; (a java.lang.Object)&#10;        - locked &lt;0x000000076ac...&gt; (a java.lang.Object)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Found one Java-level deadlock:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>=============================</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thread-1\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  waiting to lock monitor 0x00007f... (object 0x000000076ab..., a java.lang.Object),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  which is held by \"Thread-0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thread-0\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  waiting to lock monitor 0x00007f... (object 0x000000076ac..., a java.lang.Object),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  which is held by \"Thread-1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Java stack information for the threads listed above:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>===================================================</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thread-1\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        at com.example.A.b(A.java:20)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        - waiting to lock &#x3C;0x000000076ab...> (a java.lang.Object)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        - locked &#x3C;0x000000076ac...> (a java.lang.Object)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段输出把环给出来了：<code>Thread-1</code> 持 <code>6ac</code> 等 <code>6ab</code>，<code>Thread-0</code> 持 <code>6ab</code> 等 <code>6ac</code>。读到它等于问题已定位。注意 JVM 只检测<strong>监视器（<code>synchronized</code>）死锁</strong>，<code>ReentrantLock</code> 的死锁它检测不到——后者需要自己找环：对每份转储里的 <code>ReentrantLock</code> 等待者，检查 <code>Locked ownable synchronizers</code> 段（<code>Thread.print -l</code> 才输出）里持有的锁对象地址，两个线程互相出现在对方的段里就是环。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 只找死锁，输出很小&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.print -l | grep -A 30 &quot;Found one Java-level deadlock&quot;&#10;&#10;# ReentrantLock 死锁：看 locked ownable synchronizers 段&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.print -l | grep -B2 -A8 &quot;Locked ownable synchronizers&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只找死锁，输出很小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Found one Java-level deadlock\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ReentrantLock 死锁：看 locked ownable synchronizers 段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -B2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A8</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Locked ownable synchronizers\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>死锁的常见形态</strong>比「两个线程互相持锁」更隐蔽的有几种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经典环路</td>\n<td>JVM 直接报告</td>\n<td>两个锁、两个线程、相反顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套锁顺序不一致</td>\n<td>无自动报告，但单份转储可见环形持有</td>\n<td>同一锁在不同代码路径上加锁顺序不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锁 + 资源</td>\n<td>一个线程等锁，另一个等连接/文件</td>\n<td>需要跨资源看，容易漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类初始化死锁</td>\n<td>转储里线程卡在 <code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code></td>\n<td>两个类的静态初始化互相引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程池内嵌套提交</td>\n<td>池中线程阻塞等待另一个池任务</td>\n<td>池大小 × 嵌套层数的乘法效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一种「池内嵌套提交」值得展开，因为它是「没有死锁环但永远不动」的典型。线程池大小 10，某个任务内部又向<strong>同一个池</strong>提交子任务并等待结果：10 个线程全被父任务占满，子任务永远排不上队，父任务永远等不到结果——所有线程都 <code>WAITING</code>，转储里看不到任何 BLOCKED 或锁环。判据是线程栈里大量出现 <code>FutureTask.get</code> / <code>CompletableFuture.join</code> 且调用者就是池的工作线程。</p>\n<p>处置方案有三：给嵌套任务用独立池；用 <code>CompletableFuture</code> 的异步链（<code>thenCompose</code>/<code>thenApplyAsync</code>）代替阻塞等待；或者实现「托管阻塞」（<code>ForkJoinPool.ManagedBlocker</code>）让池感知阻塞并补偿线程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁竞争-从转储到时长分布\">锁竞争：从转储到时长分布</h2><p><code>BLOCKED</code> 只说明此刻在等锁，不说明等了多久。判断锁竞争是否是瓶颈需要<strong>时长</strong>，这要用 JFR 的锁事件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Java 监视器竞争（含等待时长与栈）&#10;jfr print --events jdk.JavaMonitorEnter --stack-depth 10 app.jfr | head -80&#10;&#10;# 监控器统计（竞争次数与总时长）&#10;jfr print --events jdk.JavaMonitorStatistics app.jfr&#10;&#10;# 线程 park 等待（线程池空转、latch 等待、条件变量）&#10;jfr print --events jdk.ThreadPark --stack-depth 10 app.jfr&#10;jfr print --events jdk.JavaMonitorWait --stack-depth 10 app.jfr\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Java 监视器竞争（含等待时长与栈）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.JavaMonitorEnter</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stack-depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 监控器统计（竞争次数与总时长）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.JavaMonitorStatistics</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 线程 park 等待（线程池空转、latch 等待、条件变量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.ThreadPark</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stack-depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.JavaMonitorWait</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stack-depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四个事件的语义差别必须分清，否则会把不同的瓶颈混为一谈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>对应 Java 构造</th>\n<th>等待语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>jdk.JavaMonitorEnter</code></td>\n<td>进入 <code>synchronized</code> 未获锁</td>\n<td>竞争（别处持有）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jdk.JavaMonitorWait</code></td>\n<td><code>Object.wait()</code></td>\n<td>主动等待通知（非竞争）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jdk.ThreadPark</code></td>\n<td><code>LockSupport.park</code>、<code>ReentrantLock</code>、<code>CountDownLatch</code>、<code>Future.get</code></td>\n<td>有意的等待/阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jdk.ThreadSleep</code></td>\n<td><code>Thread.sleep()</code></td>\n<td>显式休眠（代码问题）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>jdk.ThreadPark</code> 的量大<strong>不一定</strong>是问题——线程池的 worker 本来就该 park。但当 park 的栈指向业务代码的 <code>CountDownLatch.await</code> 或 <code>Future.get</code> 时，那是设计导致的串行化。区分方法是看 park 的<strong>栈顶是不是池的空转点</strong>（<code>ThreadPoolExecutor.getTask</code>）还是<strong>业务等待点</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线程池耗尽-判据与容量计算\">线程池耗尽：判据与容量计算</h2><p>这是生产环境最高频的「线程类」故障。典型现象：接口超时率上升、队列长度暴涨、<code>RejectedExecutionException</code> 开始出现（如果策略是 Abort）。</p>\n<p>判据组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 池的运行状态（需要 JMX 或 actuator；命令行下用 vmtool/ognl 取实例）&#10;#    Java 里: executor.getPoolSize() / getActiveCount() / getQueue().size() / getCompletedTaskCount()&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.print | grep -c &quot;pool-&quot;                  # worker 数量&#10;jcmd &lt;pid&gt; Thread.print | grep -A5 &quot;pool-1-thread&quot; | head  # 它们卡在哪&#10;&#10;# 2. JFR 侧：任务排队时间（提交到开始执行的延迟）&#10;#    若无自定义埋点，用 ThreadPark 的栈聚合近似&#10;jfr print --events jdk.ThreadPark --json app.jfr | \\&#10;  jq -r &#39;.recording.events[].values | select(.stackTrace.frames[0].method.type.name|test(&quot;ThreadPoolExecutor&quot;)) | .duration&#39; | \\&#10;  awk &#39;{s+=$1; n++} END {print &quot;park 次数:&quot;, n, &quot;总时长:&quot;, s}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 池的运行状态（需要 JMX 或 actuator；命令行下用 vmtool/ognl 取实例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#    Java 里: executor.getPoolSize() / getActiveCount() / getQueue().size() / getCompletedTaskCount()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pool-\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # worker 数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A5</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pool-1-thread\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 它们卡在哪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. JFR 侧：任务排队时间（提交到开始执行的延迟）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#    若无自定义埋点，用 ThreadPark 的栈聚合近似</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.ThreadPark</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  jq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.recording.events[].values | select(.stackTrace.frames[0].method.type.name|test(\"ThreadPoolExecutor\")) | .duration'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{s+=$1; n++} END {print \"park 次数:\", n, \"总时长:\", s}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>getActiveCount()</code> 贴近 <code>getMaximumPoolSize()</code>、队列持续非空、且 worker 栈全卡在下游 I/O —— 这三点同时成立就是耗尽。<strong>只在 <code>getActiveCount()</code> 高是不够的</strong>：空闲池在突发流量下也会短暂高，那不是故障。</p>\n<p>容量计算的常见错误是把线程数按 CPU 核数配：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>线程数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>核数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>等待时间</mtext><mtext>计算时间</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{线程数} = \\text{核数} \\times \\left(1 + \\frac{\\text{等待时间}}{\\text{计算时间}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">线程数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">核数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计算时间</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">等待时间</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式（Brian Goetz 在《Java Concurrency in Practice》中给出的经验式）说明线程数应由<strong>等待/计算比</strong>决定。一个调用下游 HTTP 接口耗时 200ms、本地计算 5ms 的任务，比值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span>，在 8 核机器上理论需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>328</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 \\times 41 = 328</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">41</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">328</span></span></span></span></span> 个线程。这正是「按核数配 16 个线程」的服务在依赖变慢时立刻雪崩的算术原因。</p>\n<p>但直接按公式配大池会引入新问题：线程数上升会让 GC 根扫描变长（并发收集器的停顿与线程数正相关，见 <a href=\"../gc-in-practice/zgc-shenandoah-low-latency\">ZGC 与 Shenandoah</a>）、上下文切换成本上升、下游服务承受更大并发。正确的处置组合是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>措施</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按等待/计算比调大池</td>\n<td>直接提升并发容量</td>\n<td>上限受下游承受能力约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>给下游调用设超时</td>\n<td>防止线程被慢下游长期占用</td>\n<td><strong>超时必须短于上游超时</strong>，否则白设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界队列 + 明确的拒绝策略</td>\n<td>快速失败而非无限堆积</td>\n<td>Abort 优于 CallerRuns（后者会阻塞提交方）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离池</td>\n<td>关键路径与批量任务分开</td>\n<td>避免批量任务饿死关键路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟线程</td>\n<td>把等待成本从线程上摘掉</td>\n<td>见下节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>超时配置有个反复出现的错误链：下游超时 5s → 上游超时 3s → 网关超时 1s。上游先超时并返回，但下游线程池里的线程仍被占用满 5s。<strong>超时必须从最外层往内逐层缩短</strong>，否则内层超时形同虚设，线程仍被持有。</p>\n<h2 id=\"虚拟线程-jdk-24-之后的新判据\">虚拟线程：JDK 24 之后的新判据</h2><p>虚拟线程（JDK 21 正式）改变了线程问题的形态，但<strong>没有消除它</strong>。关键变化是 JDK 24 的 <strong>JEP 491</strong>：<code>synchronized</code> 块不再导致虚拟线程 pin 住载体线程——此前这是虚拟线程最受诟病的限制，一个在 <code>synchronized</code> 里做阻塞 I/O 的虚拟线程会占住平台线程，让「虚拟线程很便宜」的前提失效。</p>\n<p>JEP 491 之后，<strong>仍然会导致 pinning 的场景</strong>缩小到：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仍会 pin 的场景</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>native 方法 / JNI 调用</td>\n<td>无法在 native 栈上切换</td>\n<td>减少 JNI；确认库的阻塞语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Object.wait()</code></td>\n<td>依赖监视器语义</td>\n<td>改用 <code>ReentrantLock</code> + <code>Condition</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类初始化 <code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code></td>\n<td>持有类初始化锁</td>\n<td>避免静态初始化里做 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分 JDK 内部实现</td>\n<td>版本相关</td>\n<td>用 <code>-Djdk.tracePinnedThreads=full</code> 确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>诊断手段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 排查 pinning（JDK 21 起支持；-Djdk.tracePinnedThreads=full 输出到 stdout）&#10;-Djdk.tracePinnedThreads=full&#10;# JFR 事件（更推荐，低开销且可长期开着）&#10;jfr print --events jdk.VirtualThreadPinned --stack-depth 20 app.jfr&#10;jfr print --events jdk.VirtualThreadSubmitFailed app.jfr&#10;jfr print --events jdk.VirtualThreadStart,jdk.VirtualThreadEnd app.jfr\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 排查 pinning（JDK 21 起支持；-Djdk.tracePinnedThreads=full 输出到 stdout）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-Djdk.tracePinnedThreads</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># JFR 事件（更推荐，低开销且可长期开着）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.VirtualThreadPinned</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stack-depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.VirtualThreadSubmitFailed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jfr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> print</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> jdk.VirtualThreadStart,jdk.VirtualThreadEnd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jfr</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>jdk.VirtualThreadPinned</code> 事件在 JDK 21 起可用，它记录 pinning 的时长与栈。<strong>判据是时长</strong>：短暂 pinning（微秒级）无害，若出现毫秒级以上的 pinning 且频繁，才会让载体线程（默认等于核数的 <code>ForkJoinPool</code>）成为瓶颈——表现为虚拟线程的吞吐不再随并发数增长。</p>\n<p>虚拟线程也带来一类新的线程池问题：<strong>误把虚拟线程塞进固定大小的池</strong>。<code>Executors.newFixedThreadPool</code> 配虚拟线程工厂，等于给虚拟线程加了并发上限，同时失去了虚拟线程的核心价值（按任务而非按线程排队）。正确做法是 <code>Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor()</code>——每任务一个虚拟线程，让调度交给 JVM。</p>\n<p>还有一条实践提醒：虚拟线程下 <code>ThreadLocal</code> 的成本问题催生了 <strong>Scoped Values</strong>（JEP 429 起孵化，JDK 25 转正为 <code>ScopedValue</code>），它提供不可变、有作用域边界的上下文传递，避免 <code>ThreadLocal</code> 在大规模虚拟线程下的内存放大。这个迁移与 <code>ThreadLocal</code> 泄漏排查（见 <a href=\"../diagnostic-toolchain/heap-dump-mat-analysis\">堆转储与 MAT 支配树分析</a>）是同一议题的两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>线程转储里的状态比 <code>Thread.State</code> 六种更有信息量：<code>RUNNABLE</code> <strong>包含阻塞式 I/O</strong>，不能当活跃线程数；<code>BLOCKED</code> 行会给出等的是哪个锁对象。</li>\n<li><strong>连续 3~5 份转储</strong>是区分「阻塞」与「缓慢」的关键判据——单份只能看「在哪」，多份才能看「是否在动」。</li>\n<li>JVM 只自动检测 <code>synchronized</code> 死锁；<code>ReentrantLock</code> 死锁需要自己比对 <code>Locked ownable synchronizers</code> 段找环。</li>\n<li>最隐蔽的形态是「池内嵌套提交」：无锁环、无 BLOCKED，全员 <code>WAITING</code> 在 <code>Future.get</code>，判据是工作线程栈里出现等自己池任务的等待。</li>\n<li>锁竞争的瓶颈判定要靠 JFR 的时长事件；<code>JavaMonitorEnter</code>（竞争）与 <code>ThreadPark</code>（有意等待）语义不同，不可混算。池 worker 在 <code>getTask</code> 上 park 是正常的，业务代码上的 park 才是问题。</li>\n<li>线程池耗尽的判据是「active 贴近 max + 队列非空 + 栈全卡在下游」三点同时成立；容量按等待/计算比计算，而不是核数。</li>\n<li>超时必须<strong>从外到内逐层缩短</strong>，否则内层超时被浪费，线程仍被持有。</li>\n<li>JDK 24 的 JEP 491 消除了 <code>synchronized</code> 的虚拟线程 pinning，但 native 方法、<code>Object.wait()</code>、<code>&lt;clinit&gt;</code> 仍会 pin；用 <code>jdk.VirtualThreadPinned</code> 按<strong>时长</strong>判断是否有害。</li>\n<li>堆外内存导致的线程级症状（如线程卡在 native 分配）需要另一条工具链，见 <a href=\"off-heap-native-memory\">堆外内存与 Native OOM：NMT 与 jemalloc 追踪</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线程栈、死锁与线程池耗尽分析","id":"线程栈-死锁与线程池耗尽分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：线程状态与转储的采集","id":"核心概念-线程状态与转储的采集"},{"level":2,"text":"死锁：检测与判据","id":"死锁-检测与判据"},{"level":2,"text":"锁竞争：从转储到时长分布","id":"锁竞争-从转储到时长分布"},{"level":2,"text":"线程池耗尽：判据与容量计算","id":"线程池耗尽-判据与容量计算"},{"level":2,"text":"虚拟线程：JDK 24 之后的新判据","id":"虚拟线程-jdk-24-之后的新判据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预热、内联与逃逸分析陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/jvm-performance-troubleshooting/hotspots-and-concurrency/jit-warmup-deoptimization"},"next":{"title":"堆外内存与 Native OOM：NMT 与 jemalloc 追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/jvm-performance-troubleshooting/hotspots-and-concurrency/off-heap-native-memory"}}